{"source":"https://github.com/fuzdev/fuz_app at e89e66081ec9, captured from its TypeScript spine by a script kept outside both repos: the in-memory test app (`create_test_app` on PGlite, with the auth, cell, and fact migrations) serving the cell RPC surface and `GET /api/account/status`, a root and 50 cells under it made through `cell_create`, with grants, items, and fields; each request is the frame a client sends (`create_jsonrpc_request` with a fresh UUID id) and each response the body as the server wrote it, and `token_scope_row` is the `scope` column of the bootstrapped API token as Postgres gives it back. `completion_progress_notification` is written by hand in the shape https://github.com/fuzdev/zzz at 5aafb254ebff sends one streamed token in: `build_text_progress_chunk` under `notification`, from `crates/zzz_server`, whose objects serde_json writes with their keys sorted","documents":[{"name":"cell_list_request","value":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"e965c233-c1e6-4eab-bd63-e2d0cba20dd6","method":"cell_list","params":{"root_id":"3505ecd5-6c74-45bc-90b6-88ee2fb9c97a","limit":50,"order_by":"created_at","order_direction":"desc"}}},{"name":"cell_create_request","value":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"1f8ef759-f499-4b51-b883-af5e9fecf584","method":"cell_create","params":{"data":{"slug":"acme/data","name":"data","default_branch":"main","seed_from":null,"seed_completed_at":null,"hook_secret_hash":"38f31cbd37f6b0efdc8f235a246b9a28b2f8865fe455df86ab033ad4476243f8","head_sha":"1dc669c1cf3a167e33478004abab5547e1796d06","last_pushed_at":"2026-11-03T16:26:06Z","last_pushed_by":"6933da4a-358d-45ef-9831-f79fc05d15c1","last_push_username":"keeper"},"kind":"repo","visibility":"public","path":"repos/acme/data","parent_id":"3505ecd5-6c74-45bc-90b6-88ee2fb9c97a"}}},{"name":"cell_list_response","value":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"e965c233-c1e6-4eab-bd63-e2d0cba20dd6","result":{"cells":[{"id":"85049acd-e121-41d1-8a43-94479ce16a46","path":null,"data":{"label":"Release notes 49","summary":"What changed,